@startuml AppointmentCreation
' Appointment Creation - Patient flow ONLY
' Scope: From patient interacting with appointment page to appointment persisted.
' Excludes: queue tickets, emails, payments, realtime updates.

skinparam style strict
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Patient User" as Patient
participant "Frontend (Patient Appointments Page)" as FE
participant "Backend API (PatientController)" as API
participant "AppointmentService" as APS
participant "AppointmentRepository" as AR <<interface>>
database "DB (appointments)" as DB

' Notes mapping to code (no hard API paths to avoid inaccuracies)
note right of FE
Source (frontend): patient-facing appointments UI/composable
File(s): frontend/... (patient module)
Action: submit new appointment request (doctorId, clinicId, start/end)
end note

note right of API
Source (backend): PatientController
Calls AppointmentService.addAppointment / validation
end note

== Create Appointment (Patient) ==
Patient -> FE: Open appointments page and fill form
activate FE
FE -> API: Submit appointment data (doctorId, clinicId, start/end)
activate API
API -> APS: addAppointment(request)
activate APS

' Validation: ensure slot available (overlap check)
APS -> AR: countOverlapping(doctorId, start, end): long
activate AR
AR --> APS: overlaps: long
deactivate AR

alt Slot not available
  APS --> API: throw ValidationError("slot unavailable")
  deactivate APS
  API --> FE: 409 Conflict / error message
  deactivate API
  FE -> Patient: Show error (choose another time)
  deactivate FE
else Slot available
  APS -> AR: save(appointment): Appointment
  activate AR
  AR -> DB: INSERT appointments
  activate DB
  DB --> AR: persisted (id)
  deactivate DB
  AR --> APS: Appointment (id,...)
  deactivate AR
  APS --> API: Appointment
  deactivate APS
  API --> FE: 201 Created + Appointment
  deactivate API
  FE -> Patient: Show confirmation (reference, time)
  deactivate FE
end

@enduml